    },
    {
      "claim": "The rolipram context shows strong species dependence (rabbit 2.8-4%, monkey 0.1%, rat 35%, human 73%), but the human gold outcome is high and rolipram is not steroid-like, so this does not contradict the query prediction.",
      "card_ids": ["C17", "C27", "C33", "C42", "C39", "C40"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "The query is a steroid-like 19-norprogesterone derivative; the closest transferable contexts are these orally bioavailable steroids, supporting F >= 20%.",
